<title>USA: IMM currency futures remain mostly lower, yen sags.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures remain mostly lower, yen sags.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 12 - IMM currency futures were mostly lower, with Sept yen grinding lower on light dealer selling. Dealers had been buyers earlier. Sept yen still remains above GLOBEX low of $0.008730. OECD said Japan's growth forecast would be lower at current yen level.</p>
